{
  "title": "We Do Care Global — Published Projects Portal & Autonomous AI Governance OS",
  "upload_type": "software",
  "description": "Author portal and open-source portfolio for We Do Care Global, founded by Emir Perla in Sarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina. The organization operates on a fundamental pledge of dedicating 33% of its annual revenue to provide financial and material assistance to vulnerable individuals worldwide for a dignified life. In technology, We Do Care Global delivers autonomous AI governance from first principles across 6 core systems: multi-agent factory orchestration (FoundationCentar), agent security and policy control planes (AgentGuard), enterprise function calling and secrets governance (AgentVault), production retrieval-augmented generation (Enterprise Hybrid-RAG with NVIDIA NeMo), agent observability and benchmarking (Agent Eval), and pharmacovigilance intelligence (Pharma Intelligence OS). Every release is archived on Zenodo with permanent DataCite DOIs under Apache-2.0 and attributed to ORCID 0009-0009-8515-2727.",
